WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.935
-Trump wore a mask publicly
for the first time.

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:04.904
It seems like a lot of guys are
having a hard time wearing masks

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.240
because they feel like
it makes them look weak.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.442
Well, I saw a commercial
that will help those guys out.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.010
Check it out.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.946
-Are you a big strong man
worried wearing a face mask

00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:16.315
will make you look like
a little girl in pigtails?!

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:18.117
Well, worry no more!

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:21.588 line:0%
Hi. I'm Lee Durango, the owner
of Masculine Man Masks,

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:23.756 line:0%
the number-one mask store
for tough guys

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:25.825 line:0%
and badass men, as well!

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:28.427 line:0%
My masks have all sorts
of manly designs...

00:00:28.427 --> 00:00:30.196 line:0%
like Predator fangs..

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:33.199 line:0%
a barbed-wire fence
around an ATV dealership...

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.835 line:0%
and a Rottweiler shredding
on an electric guitar!

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.071
-[ Electric guitar whines ]
-My masks will make you feel

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.772
like a beef-eating man,

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:41.941
not a pretty little princess
in her castle

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.109
singing to her cartoon birds!

00:00:44.109 --> 00:00:45.545
But what if you wanna look like

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.079
you're not wearing a mask
at all?!

00:00:47.079 --> 00:00:48.515
Well, I got you, brother!

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:51.451 line:0%
I also sell masks that look like
the bottom part of your mouth.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.853 line:0%
And let's just say there's
some pretty tough-guy stuff

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:56.322 line:0%
going on with
that mouth of yours!

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.057 line:0%
Like holding a toothpick...

00:00:58.057 --> 00:00:59.459 line:0%
those chin piercings

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.927 line:0%
the lead singers
of '90s new-metal bands had...

00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:04.730 line:0%
and lips stained with
award-winning barbecue sauce

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.802 line:0%
from scorching-hot ribs
that you ate over the sink!

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:11.003
My prices at Masculine Man Masks

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:13.139
blow the competitors
out of the water!

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:15.208
And just look
at the kind of junk

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:18.811 line:0%
those wimps are selling
over at Macho Mouth Mufflers.

00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:21.481 line:0%
Abs on your chest,
not your face!

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:23.516 line:0%
T-This is so confusing.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.920 line:0%
That's why we sell masks...
-With a jacked mouth!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.021 line:0%
-So come on
to Masculine Man Masks.

00:01:29.021 --> 00:01:31.024 line:0%
Because covering
the bottom half of your face

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:33.025 line:0%
doesn't have to make you
look like a big sissy

00:01:33.025 --> 00:01:34.927 line:0%
with a shellfish allergy!

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:36.729 line:0%
-Masculine Man Masks
is located next to

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.565 line:0%
Charlie's Chain Wallet Emporium

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:40.600 line:0%
and Burly Biff's
Bacon Barn and Bait Box

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:43.069
in the city's
Disturbing Dude District.

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:45.171
♪♪

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.408
-Oh, my goodness.
I -- I want one of those.

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:50.310
Those jacked --
Those jacked mouths.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.778
